      "text": "The refund is arithmetic, not discretionary. POL-RD-02 gives recomputed_fare = ((3.80 + 0.75 x 18.0 + 0.28 x 30.0) x 1.6) + 0.80 platform fee + 2.50 on-optimal-route ERP = 44.42. Charged_total is 58.10, so the refund is 58.10 - 44.42 = 13.68, rounded up to 13.70 on separate lines. That is below the 15.00 the rider contends for, and at 23.5% of the charge it is nowhere near the 90% threshold that would convert this into a FULL_REFUND.",
