      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.recomputed_fare",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider expressly accepts the 1.6 surge, and the multiplier is recorded on the fare_breakdown (not on the trip_record, which carries no such field). The recomputed fare must therefore carry the surge on base, distance and time; the refund cannot be enlarged by reading the surge as absent.",
