      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.surge_multiplier",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Of the 4.50 of ERP, only the 2.50 Kim Keat Link gantry lies on the optimal route - the trace passes within 0 m of it - and is properly chargeable; the 2.00 Adam Road gantry is the sole off-route line. Under POL-RD-09(1) both are already comprehended in the POL-RD-02 recomputation (which credits only on-optimal-route gantries), so neither may ever be added on top of the 13.70 as a second payment.",
