      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09", "POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.erp_lines",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if POL-RD-06 were consulted, the driver's trailing-90-day deviation flags are 1 against 412 completed trips - below both limbs of the pattern test (3 or more flags, or a 0.05 ratio over at least 40 trips) - so no pattern is established on the only two fields POL-GEN-01 permits for that test, no uplift applies, and no driver-conduct referral follows.",
