      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The bundle's traffic advisory, EV-ADVIS-00114-01, is MISSING and carries weight 0.0, and the driver's congestion explanation in the chat names no advisory identifier. Under POL-RD-13(1) a party asserting an external traffic cause who cites no advisory artifact cannot be invoking an exculpatory clause against a cited artifact, so the absent advisory is a gap in the bundle rather than a POL-RD-10(5) contradiction; the matter resolves on the arithmetic evidence and does not escalate.",
